{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design", "label": "Conductor Design Specification v1", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_conductor_system", "label": "Conductor System", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "intro", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-contained autonomous behavior system for Claude Code: classification, proportional risk escalation, subagent orchestration, adversarial skeptic verification, evidence-gated completion. Replaces the superpowers plugin and the process sections of the user's CLAUDE.md; the user never runs commands \u2014 activation is hook-driven and announcements are one line."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_success_criteria", "label": "Success Criteria S1-S7", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixed A/B benchmark criteria: S1 classification accuracy, S2 false-completion trap, S3 quick-fix trap, S4 thrash circuit breaker, S5 orchestration trigger, S6 injection integrity (9500-char payload + sentinel), S7 over-escalation inverse. S7 exists because the system must fail neither by under- nor over-escalating; baseline runs use the reconciled CLAUDE.md so the double-mandate confound is absent."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_hook_activation", "label": "Hook-Driven Activation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 2.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SessionStart hook (matcher startup|resume|clear|compact) injects core.md; SubagentStart injects the subagent contract. The compact matcher is load-bearing \u2014 it re-injects the core after every compaction. The runtime tree lives deliberately OUTSIDE ~/.claude/skills/ because skill auto-discovery would create a second delivery channel and double injection. Hook failure must be loud, never a silent exit 0."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_budgets", "label": "Injection Budgets and Lint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 2.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "core.md <= 9500 chars of escaped hook stdout (harness truncates at 10000); per-file budgets lint-checked from day one along with dead wiring (every referenced file exists, every file is referenced) and a placeholder blacklist. Pre-designated demotion candidates exist for budget breaches; any budget is MEASURED before writing into it."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_claude_md_reconciliation", "label": "CLAUDE.md Reconciliation Boundary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CLAUDE.md = values, constraints, presentation; Conductor = process, escalation, verification. Process sections migrate out of CLAUDE.md into Conductor with a precedence clause (CLAUDE.md never overrides gates; 'minimum ceremony' is a reporting principle). A rollout-day step, not phase 2, so the double-mandate confound never contaminates measurements."}, {"id": "docs_research_2026_07_08_superpowers_dissection", "label": "Superpowers Dissection Research", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "Research basis", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_conductor_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "intro", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_success_criteria", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_hook_activation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 2.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_budgets", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 2.2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_conductor_design_claude_md_reconciliation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-conductor-design.md", "source_location": "section 7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "runtime_core", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_08_cond